                <a href="mailto:?subject=The+Fed%3a+A+For-Purpose+Organization&amp;body=https%3a%2f%2fwww.philadelphiafed.org%2fthe-economy%2fmonetary-policy%2f201019-hope-global-forum" target="_blank">
